
### 1. Send notification in the background — expect 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/send-notification/test@example.com

### 2. Register a user — expect 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

### 3. Get all notifications — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/notifications
